  "route_rules":["Transport routes never calculate authoritative percentage, duration or cohort results from client data and never accept discarded Product as classification input.","Reusable Product Line identity carries no global SLA authority; every classification/SLA calculation resolves the Service Request Customer and a Customer-compatible Contract Product Line before authoritative use.","Policy revision affects applicable existing classified Service Requests on subsequent pure reads through the current CPL policy pointer; prior policy/classification evidence remains history rather than being rewritten.","Pure classification previews create no command receipt, classification event, current-classification mutation or audit event.","Internal report worker transitions remain non-public and are reached only through the LLD-01 durable job coordinator."]
